&_nc_oc=Adqj0NX5eeL63zVSWVRJyxMZwW3t3Z81eK2OoseuW3TFIEuHs6ovhJLIvVa6VZ6Ql04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_QdEkQYfXhLW402UhbbHyqBwOWPn0YtFdrpZSGnb54LA&oe=6A47D23E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5JdumKcI88wQ7kNvwEw2lHQ&_nc_oc=Adr01twKEmpz2BdHXVa_dWL-dA_VA65lNu3R1Tl9hPXGkHSHQvMm8ItgXx_KS3Ylg_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-TSEIwzOMMK949bcX-DXZeAjb5pv4HzZbD4CpFj8KLhQ&oe=6A47E33C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aYkCZYLsrG0Q7kNvwFOBD1E&_nc_oc=Adr2k5F1VUQYBY1_o1H4Z4cbQjnjFTX46EJTQ0oTq0iwss9m8mfhHWBfyOMKoUQcldA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af84IUphehEsQpvhCP8uzf7aZ_VBoVbi3iORK89cskMX8A&oe=6A47C987"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2y2RD-mCUpYQ7kNvwGKo2d3&_nc_oc=AdoJUtDBFFGzUv_jeW8po6AxWB-h9RbSUNug8GMAiM2mMe_yb3n6A1w6jhhE9O8wGMI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-4-cvjWFxNPjGv4F0MYQN0Rfx242HSSVIAIbMP_U5iHw&oe=6A47B555"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U9F5LNsKp6EQ7kNvwHvW-CD&_nc_oc=Adrf7-Rk66XQapFlV0zyL0zA6wJXY-11fi114EqdAJerr6LAnHTvvYUYCVp_8Psicso&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8V8tffejaujKdb1qJsKvHwTbSEdxuTAbBerPZQVXUpaw&oe=6A47C1E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.